Z||000000||pHoOl||08-30-2000||01:00 AM||||I tested the 0 to 60 time today, with a friend in the car timing it.  we both weigh around 215 pounds, and the time we achieved was around 13 seconds.  I drive an 88GT, for those who don't know.  Is this a normal performance time?  I know that a stopwatch in the car isn't very accurate, but i thought i'd be turning 9's or something.  any ideas?<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||3
